<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINA'S ACINDAR YR NET $28.17 MLN.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINA'S ACINDAR YR NET $28.17 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30.</p>
<p>Net $28.17 million vs $180 net loss</p>
<p>Q4 Net $7.7 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>Note: Steelmaker Acindar said net worth was $350.22 million and retained earnings were $28.17 million.</p>
<p>((Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
